{"2366590":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Rideshare \"Stimulator\"","steam_appid":2366590,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[5102100],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rideshare &quot;Stimulator&quot; is an immersive driving simulation game that puts you behind the wheel as a rideshare business owner. Dodge traffic, follow the rules, and race the clock to drop off your quirky passengers, each with a story that's either captivating, hilarious, or just plain weird. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because you never know who you’re going to pick up next… <\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand Your Rideshare Business: Your driving style and the condition of your vehicle directly influence how passengers react, affecting your overall rating, reviews, and tips.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have Stimulating Conversations: Each ride presents players with unique and unpredictable passenger stories, ensuring a diverse and engaging gameplay experience.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge Real-world Traffic &amp; Pedestrians: The city comes to life with dynamic real-world traffic. Wait for traffic lights, yield to pedestrians, and navigate the intricacies of a well-regulated traffic system.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a Living, Breathing City: A visually stunning game world, crafted to offer immersive environments. Cruise through streets inspired by both European and American cities, each with its unique charm and beauty<\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master Intuitive Car Controls: The game provides intuitive and accessible car controls, designed to offer an enjoyable driving experience for all players.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maintain Your Vehicle: Between rides, keep the car clean, fix what needs fixing, and make sure it’s ready for whoever gets in next.<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rideshare &quot;Stimulator&quot; is an immersive driving simulation game that puts you behind the wheel as a rideshare business owner. Dodge traffic, follow the rules, and race the clock to drop off your quirky passengers, each with a story that's either captivating, hilarious, or just plain weird. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because you never know who you’re going to pick up next… <\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand Your Rideshare Business: Your driving style and the condition of your vehicle directly influence how passengers react, affecting your overall rating, reviews, and tips.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have Stimulating Conversations: Each ride presents players with unique and unpredictable passenger stories, ensuring a diverse and engaging gameplay experience.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge Real-world Traffic &amp; Pedestrians: The city comes to life with dynamic real-world traffic. Wait for traffic lights, yield to pedestrians, and navigate the intricacies of a well-regulated traffic system.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a Living, Breathing City: A visually stunning game world, crafted to offer immersive environments. Cruise through streets inspired by both European and American cities, each with its unique charm and beauty<\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master Intuitive Car Controls: The game provides intuitive and accessible car controls, designed to offer an enjoyable driving experience for all players.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maintain Your Vehicle: Between rides, keep the car clean, fix what needs fixing, and make sure it’s ready for whoever gets in next.<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"Build your rideshare business while navigating real-world traffic, managing your vehicle, and transporting a wide range of unique passengers. Master the streets, keep your car in shape, and deliver every ride, no matter how strange it gets.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong>, French<strong>*<\/strong>, Russian<strong>*<\/strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*<\/strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*<\/strong>, German<strong>*<\/strong><br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2366590\/40f269982e4b124824113ddfb4c4b59e41e386c1\/header.jpg?t=1792511496","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2366590\/26dc22987a59a8fb8ae11aa19bd4c1fbb6d553c3\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1792511496","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2366590\/26dc22987a59a8fb8ae11aa19bd4c1fbb6d553c3\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1792511496","website":"https:\/\/saber.games\/rideshare\/","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10\/11 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> AMD Ryzen 5 1500X (4C\/8T) \/ Intel Core i5-8400 (6C\/6T)<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 16 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> 6 GB VRAM, NVIDIA GTX 1060 \/ AMD RX 590<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 12<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 50 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> SSD required<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10\/11 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel i5-10400 (6C\/12T @ 2900) \/ AMD Ryzen 5 3600 (6C\/12T @ 3600)<br><\/li><li><strong>M